## Summary

Architecture: Modular app-chain framework (Cosmos SDK) dengan hub-and-zone topology; CometBFT BFT consensus; IBC cross-chain messaging; sovereign chains connected via light client verification
Core Components: Cosmos SDK, CometBFT, IBC (ibc-go), Cosmos Hub (Gaia), Interchain Security, Liquid Staking Module (LSM), CosmWasm, Packet Forward Middleware (PFM), Interchain Accounts (ICA)
Audit Count: 8 major audits (NCC Group, Trail of Bits x4, Informal Systems formal verification x2, Oak Security x2) covering Tendermint Core, Cosmos SDK, IBC, CometBFT, CosmWasm, Interchain Security, LSM, IBC-Go v7
Major Upgrade Count: 10 major Cosmos Hub upgrades (v1 genesis through v19) + CometBFT fork (v0.34) + CometBFT v1.0 stable + IBC v7/PFM

## Open Threads

- Daftar lengkap auditor dan tanggal audit untuk setiap modul Cosmos SDK (auth, bank, staking, governance, distribution, slashing, ibc, dll) — tidak tersedia dalam single source terpusat
- Status verifikasi formal (Coq/Isabelle) untuk CometBFT consensus safety/liveness — Informal Systems melakukan tapi tidak semua hasil dipublikasikan
- Detail teknis ABCI++ (Application Blockchain Interface++) — masih experimental, spesifikasi berubah cepat, adoption timeline tidak pasti
- Status ZK-light client untuk IBC (zkTendermint, zkIBC) — R&D stage, tidak ada testnet integration resmi
- Detail implementasi threshold encryption (FVE - Fair Validated Execution) di Osmosis — masih closed testnet, tidak ada spec publik lengkap
- Status Interchain Security v2 (Partial Set Security, Opt-in Security) — roadmap item, tidak ada testnet launch tanggal pasti
- Parameter teknis LSM terkini on-chain (cap %, validator bonding, redemption rate, epochs) — butuh query on-chain langsung
- Daftar chain yang masih menggunakan Tendermint Core legacy vs CometBFT — tidak ada registry terpusat migrasi
- Spec teknis Packet Forward Middleware (PFM) fee market dan recursion limits — IBC-Go v7 docs tersebar
- Status CosmWasm 2.0 (multi-contract atomic execution, better upgradeability) — roadmap, tidak ada release date resmi